OL,3,GNEWSAFirst trains depart from brand new
OL,4,Astation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new rail station has welcomed its
OL,7,Ffirst passenger train services ahead of
OL,8,Fthousands of new homes and a 20,000
OL,9,Fcapacity events venue being built
OL,10,Fnearby.
OL,12,FBrabazon station is Bristol's third new
OL,13,Fstation in three years and ran its
OL,14,Ffirst service to Bristol Temple Meads
OL,15,Fearlier.
OL,17,FThe station will eventually serve as
OL,18,Fthe transport hub for the new homes
OL,19,Fbeing built at one of the government's
OL,20,Flisted 'New Town' sites and people
OL,21,Fheading to the Aviva music arena.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
