OL,3,GNEWSAFirst trains depart from brand new
OL,4,Astation
OL,5,
OL,6,F"To know that [people] have a gateway
OL,7,Fin to Bristol city centre and
OL,8,Feverything that goes beyond that...
OL,9,Fthat is really exciting for us and our
OL,10,Fvisitor economy," said Labour's West of
OL,11,FEngland Mayor Helen Godwin.
